### Criar Usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

###

### Listar Todos os Usuários
GET http://localhost:3000/users

###

### Buscar Usuário por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/users/SEU_ID_AQUI

###

### Teste - Email já existe (deve retornar erro)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "senha456"
}

###

### Teste - Validação (deve retornar erro)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "password": "123"
}
